{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Instant Wellness Kits API","description":"REST API for order management with automatic NY State tax calculation.\n\n## Key Features\n- **Native GeoJSON tax calculation** — point-in-polygon lookup, no external API calls\n- **Tax breakdown** — state, county, city, and special district rates\n- **Region classification** — NYC, Long Island, Hudson Valley, Capital District, Upstate\n- **High-performance CSV import** — virtual threads, ~11k records/sec\n- **Multi-file upload** — import multiple CSVs in one request\n- **CSV export** — download filtered orders as CSV\n- **Import file tracking** — per-file metadata with out-of-NY detection\n- **Dashboard analytics** — cached aggregated stats with region/county breakdown\n- **Map visualization** — GeoJSON order points, county aggregations, boundary layers\n\n## Authentication\nCurrently all endpoints are open (no auth required).\n\n## Pagination\nAll list endpoints support Spring Data pagination:\n- `page` — 0-indexed page number (default: 0)\n- `size` — page size (default: 20)\n- `sort` — field + direction, e.g. `sort=totalAmount,desc`\n\n## Regions\nOrders within NY are classified into regions:\n| Region | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `NYC` | Five boroughs (Manhattan, Brooklyn, Queens, Bronx, Staten Island) |\n| `Long Island` | Nassau, Suffolk counties |\n| `Hudson Valley` | Westchester, Rockland, Putnam, Dutchess, Orange, Sullivan, Ulster |\n| `Capital District` | Albany, Rensselaer, Saratoga, Schenectady |\n| `Upstate` | All other NY counties |\n| `Out of State` | Coordinates outside New York State |\n\n## Tech Stack\nSpring Boot 4.0 · PostgreSQL · Redis · GeoJSON (JTS Topology Suite)\n","contact":{"name":"Acheron Team","email":"support@acheron.com"},"version":"2.0"},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.ya3.uk","description":"Production server"},{"url":"http://localhost:8080","description":"Local development server"}],"tags":[{"name":"Map","description":"GeoJSON order points, per-county aggregations, NY boundary layers, CSV preview"},{"name":"Map","description":"Map data API — per-county aggregated data, GeoJSON orders, boundary layers, CSV preview"},{"name":"Tax Localities","description":"Manage NY State tax locality data — rates, counties, special districts"},{"name":"Tax Localities","description":"NY State tax locality data — rates, counties, special districts, reload/import"},{"name":"Batch Import","description":"IGNORE!!! USE NATIVE IMPORT!!! Async CSV import with real-time progress tracking via SSE"},{"name":"Users","description":"User management (SUPER_ADMIN only)"},{"name":"Orders","description":"CRUD, filtering, CSV import/export, and import file tracking for orders"},{"name":"Auth","description":"Authentication endpoints"},{"name":"Orders","description":"Order management API with native GeoJSON tax calculation"},{"name":"Dashboard","description":"Aggregated statistics for the dashboard — cached with 10min TTL"},{"name":"Dashboard","description":"Aggregated analytics — totals, top counties, region breakdown, tax rate distribution"}],"paths":{"/tax-localities":{"get":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Get all tax localities (paginated)","description":"Returns paginated NY State tax localities with rates, reporting codes, and district flags. Use `page`, `size`, `sort` query params (e.g. `?page=0&size=20&sort=locality,asc`).","operationId":"getAllTaxLocalities","parameters":[{"name":"pageable","in":"query","description":"Pagination parameters (page, size, sort)","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pageable"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Paginated list of tax localities","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagedModelTaxLocality"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Create a single tax locality","operationId":"createTaxLocality","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxLocality"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Created","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxLocality"}}}}}}},"/tax-localities/reload":{"post":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Reload tax localities from built-in JSON","description":"Deletes ALL existing tax localities and reloads from the bundled ny-tax-localities.json file. Clears all caches.","operationId":"reloadFromJson","responses":{"200":{"description":"Reloaded successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}},"500":{"description":"Failed to reload","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/tax-localities/import":{"post":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Import tax localities from custom JSON body","description":"Deletes ALL existing tax localities and replaces them with the provided JSON array. Clears all caches.","operationId":"importFromJson","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"string"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Imported successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid JSON","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/orders":{"get":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Get all orders (filtered + paginated)","description":"Retrieves a paginated list of orders with optional filters.\n\n**Pagination** (query params):\n\n- `page` — page number (0-indexed, default 0)\n\n- `size` — page size (default 20)\n\n- `sort` — sort field + direction, e.g. `sort=totalAmount,desc`\n\n**Filters** (all optional):\n\n- `minLat` / `maxLat` — bounding box latitude range\n\n- `minLon` / `maxLon` — bounding box longitude range\n\n- `minSubtotal` / `maxSubtotal` — subtotal range (before tax)\n\n- `minTotal` / `maxTotal` — total amount range (after tax)\n\n- `minTaxRate` / `maxTaxRate` — composite tax rate range (e.g. 0.04 to 0.09)\n\n- `from` / `to` — date range (ISO 8601, e.g. `2024-01-01T00:00:00`)\n\n- `withinNewYork` — `true` = valid NY orders only, `false` = out-of-state only\n\n- `counties` — filter by county names (comma-separated, case-insensitive, e.g. `Suffolk,Nassau`)\n\n- `regions` — filter by regions (comma-separated): `NYC`, `Long Island`, `Hudson Valley`, `Capital District`, `Upstate`, `Out of State`\n\n- `manualOnly` — `true` = only manually created orders (no import file), `false` = only imported orders\n\n- `importFileId` — filter by import file UUID\n\n- `importFileIds` — filter by multiple import file UUIDs (comma-separated)\n\n**Example**: `GET /orders?page=0&size=10&sort=orderedAt,desc&withinNewYork=true&counties=Suffolk,Nassau&manualOnly=true`","operationId":"getAllOrders","parameters":[{"name":"pageable","in":"query","description":"Pagination (page, size, sort)","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pageable"}},{"name":"minLat","in":"query","description":"Min latitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLat","in":"query","description":"Max latitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minLon","in":"query","description":"Min longitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLon","in":"query","description":"Max longitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Min subtotal (before tax)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Max subtotal (before tax)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTotal","in":"query","description":"Min total amount (after tax)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTotal","in":"query","description":"Max total amount (after tax)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Min composite tax rate (e.g. 0.04)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Max composite tax rate (e.g. 0.09)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"From date (ISO 8601)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","description":"To date (ISO 8601)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"withinNewYork","in":"query","description":"Filter by NY validity: true = within NY, false = outside NY","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"counties","in":"query","description":"Filter by county names (comma-separated, case-insensitive)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"regions","in":"query","description":"Filter by regions (comma-separated)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"manualOnly","in":"query","description":"Filter: true = manual orders only, false = imported only","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"importFileId","in":"query","description":"Filter by import file UUID","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"importFileIds","in":"query","description":"Filter by multiple import file UUIDs","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}},{"name":"userId","in":"query","description":"Filter by user UUID (SUPER_ADMIN only)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Orders retrieved successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OrderResponse"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Create new order","description":"Creates a new order with automatic tax calculation based on coordinates using native GeoJSON point-in-polygon lookup. No external API calls.","operationId":"createOrder","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OrderRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"Order created successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/OrderResponse"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid request or location outside NY State"}}}},"/orders/import":{"post":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Import orders from one or more CSV files","description":"High-performance CSV import using virtual threads and native GeoJSON point-in-polygon tax calculation.\nNo external API calls. Processes ~11k records/sec.\n\nAccepts **one or more** CSV files. Each file is processed independently.\n\nCSV columns: `id, longitude, latitude, timestamp, subtotal`\n\nResponse includes per-file results with:\n- **importFileId** — UUID of the persisted import file record\n- **outOfNyRecords** — count of rows outside New York State\n- **outOfNyRows** — first 200 out-of-NY rows with coordinates (for review)\n- **errors** — first 100 parse/save errors with line numbers","operationId":"importCsv","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"file":{"type":"array","description":"One or more CSV files with columns: id, longitude, latitude, timestamp, subtotal","items":{"type":"string","format":"binary"}}},"required":["file"]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Import completed","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ImportResult"}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid CSV file"}}}},"/map/csv-preview":{"post":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Preview CSV points on map (no save)","description":"Parses CSV → GeoJSON points for map preview. Does NOT persist. Includes point count and subtotal sum.","operationId":"previewCsvOnMap","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"file":{"type":"string","format":"binary","description":"CSV file: id, longitude, latitude, timestamp, subtotal"}},"required":["file"]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/geo+json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/map/cache/clear":{"post":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Clear GeoJSON tax calc cache","operationId":"clearCache","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"/dashboard/cache/evict":{"post":{"tags":["Dashboard"],"summary":"Evict dashboard & map caches","description":"Clears the cached dashboard and map data. Next request will recompute from DB.","operationId":"evictCaches","responses":{"200":{"description":"Caches evicted","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}},"/auth/register":{"post":{"tags":["Auth"],"summary":"Register a new user","operationId":"register","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RegisterRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthResponse"}}}}}}},"/auth/login":{"post":{"tags":["Auth"],"summary":"Login with email and password","operationId":"login","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/LoginRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/AuthResponse"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import":{"post":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Start async CSV import","description":"Queues a CSV file for asynchronous batch processing. Returns immediately with job ID for tracking progress via SSE.","operationId":"startImport","requestBody":{"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"file":{"type":"string","format":"binary","description":"CSV file with columns: latitude, longitude, subtotal, timestamp"}},"required":["file"]}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Import job queued successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string","example":{"message":"Import job queued successfully","jobId":1,"filename":"orders.csv","status":"QUEUED"}}}}},"400":{"description":"Invalid file or upload failed"}}}},"/users":{"get":{"tags":["Users"],"summary":"Get all users (SUPER_ADMIN only)","operationId":"getAllUsers","parameters":[{"name":"pageable","in":"query","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pageable"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagedModelUserResponse"}}}}}}},"/tax-localities/{locality}":{"get":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Find tax locality by name","description":"Lookup a specific locality by name (case-insensitive, normalizes county suffixes and NYC borough aliases).","operationId":"getTaxLocality","parameters":[{"name":"locality","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Tax locality found","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxLocality"}}}},"404":{"description":"Locality not found","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/TaxLocality"}}}}}},"delete":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Delete a tax locality by name","operationId":"deleteTaxLocality","parameters":[{"name":"locality","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"204":{"description":"No Content"}}}},"/tax-localities/current":{"get":{"tags":["Tax Localities"],"summary":"Get current tax rates with effective date","description":"Returns all tax localities with the current effective date.\nThis endpoint provides the latest tax rate data as loaded in the system.\nUse `POST /tax-localities/reload` to refresh from the bundled JSON file.","operationId":"getCurrentTaxRates","responses":{"200":{"description":"Current tax rates returned","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/orders/import-files":{"get":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"List import files (paginated, user-scoped)","description":"Returns a paginated list of imported CSV files, sorted by import date descending.\nRegular admins see only their own files. SUPER_ADMIN sees all files by default,\nor can filter by userId.\nEach entry includes file metadata, record counts (total, success, failed, out-of-NY), and processing stats.","operationId":"listImportFiles","parameters":[{"name":"pageable","in":"query","description":"Pagination (page, size, sort)","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Pageable"}},{"name":"userId","in":"query","description":"Filter by user UUID (SUPER_ADMIN only)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Import files retrieved","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagedModelImportFileResponse"}}}}}}},"/orders/export":{"get":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Export orders as CSV","description":"Downloads the orders table as a CSV file.\nSupports **all the same filters** as `GET /orders`.\n\nThe CSV includes columns:\n`id, latitude, longitude, subtotal, composite_tax_rate, tax_amount, total_amount,\nordered_at, is_within_new_york, county, region, state_rate, county_rate, city_rate,\nspecial_rates, jurisdictions`\n\n**Example**: `GET /orders/export?withinNewYork=true&county=Suffolk`","operationId":"exportOrdersCsv","parameters":[{"name":"minLat","in":"query","description":"Min latitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLat","in":"query","description":"Max latitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minLon","in":"query","description":"Min longitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLon","in":"query","description":"Max longitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Min subtotal","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Max subtotal","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTotal","in":"query","description":"Min total","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTotal","in":"query","description":"Max total","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Min tax rate","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Max tax rate","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"From date (ISO 8601)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","description":"To date (ISO 8601)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"withinNewYork","in":"query","description":"Within New York","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"counties","in":"query","description":"Filter by county names (comma-separated)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"regions","in":"query","description":"Filter by regions (comma-separated)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},{"name":"manualOnly","in":"query","description":"Filter: true = manual orders only, false = imported only","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean"}},{"name":"importFileId","in":"query","description":"Import file UUID","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"importFileIds","in":"query","description":"Filter by multiple import file UUIDs","required":false,"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}},{"name":"userId","in":"query","description":"Filter by user UUID (SUPER_ADMIN only)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"CSV file streamed","content":{"text/csv":{}}},"500":{"description":"Error generating CSV"}}}},"/map/orders":{"get":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Get orders as GeoJSON with filters + aggregate summary","description":"Returns orders as a GeoJSON FeatureCollection with rich filtering:\n- **Bounding box**: minLat/maxLat/minLon/maxLon for viewport loading\n- **Subtotal range**: minSubtotal/maxSubtotal\n- **Tax rate range**: minTaxRate/maxTaxRate (composite rate, e.g. 0.08)\n- **Date range**: from/to (ISO datetime)\n- **Limit**: max features returned (default 10000)\n\nResponse includes `summary` with aggregate totals for the filtered set.","operationId":"getOrdersGeoJson","parameters":[{"name":"minLat","in":"query","description":"Min latitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLat","in":"query","description":"Max latitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minLon","in":"query","description":"Min longitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLon","in":"query","description":"Max longitude (bounding box)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Min subtotal filter","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Max subtotal filter","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Min composite tax rate (e.g. 0.04)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTaxRate","in":"query","description":"Max composite tax rate (e.g. 0.09)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"from","in":"query","description":"From date (ISO, e.g. 2024-01-01T00:00:00)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"to","in":"query","description":"To date (ISO, e.g. 2024-12-31T23:59:59)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","description":"Max features to return (default 10000)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":10000}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"GeoJSON FeatureCollection with summary","content":{"application/geo+json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/map/counties":{"get":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Get per-county aggregated map data (cached)","description":"Returns per-county aggregated data for map visualization (cached for 10 minutes).\nEach entry includes:\n- **county** — county name\n- **order_count** — number of orders in this county\n- **total_subtotal** — sum of subtotals (netto)\n- **total_tax** — sum of tax amounts\n- **total_revenue** — sum of totals (brutto)\n- **average_tax_rate** — average composite tax rate\n- **average_order_value** — average total per order\n\nSorted by order count descending. Use `POST /dashboard/cache/evict` to force refresh.","operationId":"getCountyData","responses":{"200":{"description":"Per-county aggregated data","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MapCountyResponse"}}}}}}}},"/map/cache/stats":{"get":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Get GeoJSON tax calc cache stats","operationId":"getCacheStats","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/map/boundaries/counties":{"get":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Get NY county boundaries GeoJSON","operationId":"getCountyBoundaries","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/geo+json":{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"byte"}}}}}}},"/map/boundaries/boroughs":{"get":{"tags":["Map"],"summary":"Get NYC borough boundaries GeoJSON","operationId":"getBoroughBoundaries","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/geo+json":{"schema":{"type":"string","format":"byte"}}}}}}},"/dashboard":{"get":{"tags":["Dashboard"],"summary":"Get dashboard statistics","description":"Returns aggregated dashboard stats (cached in-memory for 10 minutes):\n\n**Overview metrics:**\n\n- `total_orders` — total number of orders\n\n- `valid_orders` / `invalid_orders` — within NY vs outside\n\n- `total_subtotal` — sum of all subtotals (before tax, netto)\n\n- `total_tax` — sum of all tax amounts\n\n- `total_revenue` — sum of all totals (after tax, brutto)\n\n- `average_order_value` — revenue / order count\n\n- `average_tax_rate` — average composite tax rate for valid orders\n\n- `min_subtotal` / `max_subtotal` — subtotal range\n\n**Breakdowns:**\n\n- `top_counties` — top 10 counties by order count with subtotal & revenue\n\n- `region_breakdown` — per-region stats (NYC, Long Island, Hudson Valley, Capital District, Upstate) with order count, revenue, and avg tax rate\n\n- `tax_rate_distribution` — order count grouped by tax rate buckets (< 4%, 4-7%, 7-8%, 8-9%, >= 9%)\n\nUse `POST /dashboard/cache/evict` to force a refresh.","operationId":"getDashboardStats","responses":{"200":{"description":"Dashboard stats retrieved","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DashboardResponse"}}}}}}},"/auth/me":{"get":{"tags":["Auth"],"summary":"Get current authenticated user","operationId":"me","responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UserResponse"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import/{jobId}":{"get":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Get job details","description":"Retrieves detailed information about a specific batch import job including status, metrics, and timing","operationId":"getJobDetails","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","description":"Job ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Job details retrieved","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/BatchJobResponse"}}}},"404":{"description":"Job not found"}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import/{jobId}/report":{"get":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Get complete job report","description":"Retrieves comprehensive job report including job details and all error records. Suitable for export as JSON.","operationId":"getJobReport","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","description":"Job ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Report generated successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"string","example":"{\"job\": {...}, \"errors\": [...]}"}}}},"404":{"description":"Job not found"}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import/{jobId}/errors":{"get":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Get job errors","description":"Retrieves all error details for failed records in a specific job. Includes coordinates, error type, and messages.","operationId":"getJobErrors","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","description":"Job ID","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Errors retrieved successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}},"404":{"description":"Job not found"}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import/status/{jobId}":{"get":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Stream job status via SSE","description":"Establishes Server-Sent Events connection for real-time job progress updates. Auto-closes when job completes or fails. Updates every 1 second.","operationId":"streamJobStatus","parameters":[{"name":"jobId","in":"path","description":"Job ID returned from start import","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int64"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"SSE stream established","content":{"text/event-stream":{}}},"404":{"description":"Job not found"}}}},"/api/v1/orders/import/history":{"get":{"tags":["Batch Import"],"summary":"Get job history","description":"Retrieves paginated list of all batch import jobs ordered by creation date (newest first)","operationId":"getJobHistory","parameters":[{"name":"page","in":"query","description":"Page number (0-indexed)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":0}},{"name":"size","in":"query","description":"Page size (max 100)","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32","default":20}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Job history retrieved successfully","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PagedModel"}}}}}}},"/orders/by-import-file/{importFileId}":{"delete":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Delete orders by import file","description":"Soft-deletes all orders from a specific import file.","operationId":"deleteByImportFile","parameters":[{"name":"importFileId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Orders deleted","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/orders/by-ids":{"delete":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Delete orders by IDs","description":"Soft-deletes orders by a list of order UUIDs. Non-SUPER_ADMIN users can only delete their own orders.","operationId":"deleteByIds","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Orders deleted","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}},"400":{"description":"Empty ID list","content":{"*/*":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{}}}}}}}},"/orders/by-filter":{"delete":{"tags":["Orders"],"summary":"Delete orders by filter","description":"Soft-deletes all orders matching the provided filters.\nSupports **all the same filters** as `GET /orders`.\nReturns the count of deleted orders.","operationId":"deleteByFilter","parameters":[{"name":"minLat","in":"query","description":"Min latitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLat","in":"query","description":"Max latitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minLon","in":"query","description":"Min longitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxLon","in":"query","description":"Max longitude","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Min subtotal","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxSubtotal","in":"query","description":"Max subtotal","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"minTotal","in":"query","description":"Min total","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"}},{"name":"maxTotal","in":"query","description":"Max total","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number"